    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isandīko lya ng'wa Seeba kwenhwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūlomana na a batūmami ba mu selekali yakwe, hamò na a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī-shihūmbī, na a bigana-igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbawīla a Baisilaeli a bose gīkī, “Ūlū būlī būtogwa wa ng'wa Seeba Mulungu wise, na a bing'we ūlū gūlīmubeelela ū mu miso ging'we, tūbatwalīlagi mhola na a badūgū bise a bangī hose-hose ūko balī ū mu sī ya Isilaeli: babize balī kūle nūūlū balī bbihī; na a bagabīji na a Balawī abo bakwikalaga hamò nabo ū kū mizengo yabo nū mu sī ja madīīmīlo gabo; a bose bize twibilinge hamò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūlyenhe ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu wise ūmu twikale nalyo, nguno ū mu shikū ja ng'wa Saulo twalī twalīgumanīja sagala dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū abo baalī bibilinga būzunya ū kūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo, nguno pye a banhū bakagūbona gwabeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūbabilinga a Baisilaeli a bose, kwandīja abo bikalaga kū mongo gwa Shihooli gwa Misili, kūshisha Lebo Hamasi; gīkī baje ī Kiliati-yealimu bakalyenhe ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a Baisilaeli a bose būja ī Baala ya Yuda (hū ī Kiliati-yelimu), ū kūlyenha kūfuma koi ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu; ī lisandīko īlo līkitanagwa mu Lina lyenīlo, lya ng'wa Seeba ūyo isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi līlī ha gatī-gatī ya makelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu būlītūūla h'igogteeni ipya, hūna būlyīnja a ha ng'wa Abinadabu; Uza na Ahiyo bakūlītongeelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a Baisilaeli a bose baalī bayega no ū kū būtongi wa ng'wa Mulungu, babinaga na ngunzu jabo jose, kūnū bakwīmbaga na kūtūla ndono, malimba, tūng'oma tūdo-tūdo, nzege, na kūfuula mbiilūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshika ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla lwa ha ng'wa Kidoni, ī ng'ombe jiguumha; ū Uza ūgoloola nkono ūlīdima ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu kūlīhangīja lītizūgwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū būpelanu wa ng'wa SEEBA būmpembekela ū Uza, ūntūla kūlwa nguno akatūūla nkono gwakwe a hisandīko; ūchīīla henaho ha būtongi wa ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūsaaya nguno ū būpelanu wa ng'wa SEEBA būkampembekela ū Uza; ī lipandī lyenīlo ūlitana Pelezi-uza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Daūdi ūng'ogoha ū Mulungu; ūhaya, “Nadūgije kinehe ū kūlyenha a ha ng'wane ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlemeelwa ū kūlīshikīlīja ī lisandīko ū mu nzengo gwa ng'wa Daūdi, gīkī akikale nalyo. Ūlīlija ha ng'wa Obedi-edomu, ūmò wa Bagītī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu lyikala a ha kaya ya ng'wa Obedi-edomu ikanza lya myeji īdatū, ū SEEBA ūng'wīlūkīla mbango ningī no ū munhū ng'wenūyo nī kaaya yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
